<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Repco rises on requotation.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Repco rises on requotation.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Repco Holdings Bhd were up 2.8 percent on requotation after a two-week suspension.</p>
<p>At 0150 GMT, the stock was up 1.75 ringgit to 64.25 on volume of 72,000 shares traded.</p>
<p>The timber and gaming firm earlier announced its acquisition of a holding company with two sawmill operations for 25 million ringgit.</p>
<p>The stock was voluntarily suspended on August 15.</p>
